      "created_at": "2020-10-13T23:53:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint by Relics in trash with everyone mid teens.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Like TakeWalker, pretty standard Gloomweaver game. Had Strength out with the Pouch for a bit, but took care of both soon enough.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I actually used Cleansing Downpour more often than not simply because there was nothing worth doing 1 projectile damage to on the field.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>~A-Kat</p>",
